continuations-roadmap
owner: fable-5.1 session 53f400ad
started: 2026-09-16
what: the operator's ask (2026-09-16): a spec and a plan for the further
  development of continuations — what exists, what a built Free tree can
  and cannot be compiled into (it is a coroutine, not a syntax tree), and
  four roads ranked by expected gain: fused multi-effect handling (one
  walk for N handlers), staged direct blocks (known handlers → Func at
  compile time), typestate on the facade (freer-base stage 2), and
  defunctionalized continuations for migration (a horizon, measured
  before started). Prose: specs/continuations-roadmap.md, BACKLOG,
  ROADMAP.
files: specs/continuations-roadmap.md, BACKLOG.md, ROADMAP.md, CHANGELOG.md
